Files derived from ENERO and modified in this work:
  - code/gym-graph/: environments Env15 and Env16 migrated from OpenAI Gym to
    Gymnasium (step/reset API, declared spaces, unwrapped access). The SAP
    environment (Env20) and the DEFO result reader were removed.
  - code/gym-graph/gym_graph/envs/environment17.py: new environment based on
    Env16, with a corrected reward (load-dispersion term computed without bias).
  - code/gym-graph/gym_graph/envs/topology_reader.py: reduced topology reader
    derived from ENERO's defo_process_results.py (only the parts that read the
    network topology are kept).
  - code/agent/actor.py, code/agent/critic.py: layer normalization in the GNN
    update and configurable hyperparameters.
  - code/training/: CPU training in resumable chunks, Gymnasium API, corrected
    reward and extended logging.
  - code/evaluation/local_search.py: Hill Climbing local search adapted from
    ENERO's single-topology evaluation script.
  - code/utils/convert_dataset.py: adapted to the new folder layout.
  Comments, docstrings and messages were translated into English, and the files
  were renamed and reorganized into packages.

New files written for this work: code/compression/, code/evaluation/evaluate.py,
code/evaluation/milp.py, code/evaluation/run_*.py, code/analysis/,
code/figures/, code/config.py, and all the trained models and results in
code/models/ and code/results/.

The ENERO dataset (topologies and traffic matrices) is not redistributed here;
it must be downloaded from the original repository.
